{"strongs": "H0775", "word": "אַרְפַּכְשַׁד", "translit": "ar.pakh.shad", "root": "ארן", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "3rd son of Shem", "definition": "אַרְפַּכְשַׁד proper name, masculine 3rd son of Shem ׳ א Gen 10:22 ; Gen 10:24 ; Gen 11:12 ; Gen 11:13 ; 1Chr 1:17 ; 1Chr 1:18 ; 1Chr 1:24 אַרְפַּכְשָׁ֑ד Gen 11:10 ; Gen 11:11 doubtless a geographic name (derivation & meaning dubious, Thes derives from boundary (stem define, limit ), compare also Ethiopic wall , + כשׁד = כֶּשֶׂד , i.e. Chaldean ; so Schr COT Gen 10:22 who identifies with Babylonia (compare Gen 11:12 f. & אוּר כַּשְׂדִּים v Gen 11:28 v Gen 11:31 ); see another interpretations Dl Pa 255 ; according to most = Arrapachitis on Upper Zab, northeast from Nineveh, Assyrian Arba—a , Armen. Albak Lag Armen. Stud. 55 & references so Bo MV , Di Gen 10:22 Lag Sy i. 54 Nö ZMG 1882, 182 ; but Assyrian Arba—a is unfavourable to this).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB779')\">BDB779</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H775')\">H775</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB778')\">BDB778</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB780')\">BDB780</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אַרְפַּכְשַׁד</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <highlightword>3rd son of Shem</highlightword> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 10:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,22)\">Gen 10:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 10:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,10,24)\">Gen 10:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:12\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,12)\">Gen 11:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 11:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,13)\">Gen 11:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,1,17)\">1Chr 1:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 1:18